        {
          "title": "How I feel about AI",
          "url": "https://beza1e1.tuxen.de/ai_feelings.html",
          "source": "Hacker News",
          "date": "2026-09-06T15:00:19Z",
          "language": "en",
          "section": "us_news",
          "raw_content": "I feel surprise at how well neural networks work. LLMs work like \"gut feeling\" as they just generate one more token after another. There is no planning or reasoning algorithm inside. Yet, some planning and reasoning emerges. I feel fear about an impending doom. Yudkowsky's argument that a superintelligent AI will inevitably destroy humanity seems to have no flaw. Yet, nobody seriously tries to sandbox AIs because they are too useful with access.",
          "organization": "",
          "arxiv_id": "",
          "link_verified": true,
          "focus_match": [
            "ai-ml"
          ],
          "priority_hint": 7,
